  "originalText": "[Code Name] W\n[Gender] Female\n[Combat Experience] 11 Years\n[Place of Birth] Kazdel\n[Date of Birth] Claims to have forgotten\n[Race] Sarkaz\n[Height] 165cm\n[Infection Status] \nConfirmed Infected by medical examination.",
